  "A plugin for every dream, every desire": "",
  "Thousands of community plugins are available for Omarchy. Don't find what you need? Just put your agent on the job, then share when done.": "",
  "Pick a theme, change everything": "",
  "A theme restyles the whole system at once: terminal, bar, notifications, wallpaper. Pick one and this site wears it too.": "",
  "Or press": "",
  "to flip through them.": "",
  "What's been happening": "",
  "Momentum by the numbers": "",
  "Donations, downloads, and contributions. Momentum is based on all of it.": "",
  "People love Omarchy": "",
  "What people posted on X after installing it.": "",
  "It takes a village to raise a distro": "",
  "Omarchy Core sets the direction, the Security team keeps your system safe, Design shapes how it looks and feels, and the Rangers help others find their way.": "",
  "Backed by the oligarchy": "",
  "The billionaires, mere millionaires, and corporations funding the lion's share of the development, maintenance, and spread of Omarchy.": "",
  "Get involved with Omarchy": "",
  "Command your agent, and hang out with the people doing the same.": "",
  "When you can vibe code whatever app comes to your mind, you should be able to vibe code your operating system.": "",
  "Creator of Omarchy": "",
  "Watch him say it, on YouTube": "",
  "Choose your agent": "",
  "On first boot, Omarchy invites you to set up a default agent. Pick your favorite, sign in, and put it to work on your computer.": "",
  "Make sense of a crash": "",
  "When an app crashes, click the notification to send your agent on the case. It can examine the crash dump, diagnose what went wrong, and help report the bug.": "",
  "Make it your own": "",
  "Omarchy ships with skills to help your agent make apps, plugins, and themes. Describe what you want, try what it builds, and share it with everyone.": "",
  "Meet your new agent": "",
  "The agentic OS for the age of agents": "",
  "Your agent should feel at home on your computer. Omarchy gives it the tools and skills to help you understand, fix, and shape the whole system.": "",
  "Supported agent harnesses": "",
  "Your editor, integrated": "",
  "Neovim is the default, with VSCode, Cursor, Zed, Sublime Text, Helix, Vim, and Emacs ready to install. Pick your favorite and make it the system-wide default.": "",
  "Choose your editor": "",
  "Your stack, ready to go": "",
  "Install Ruby on Rails, Laravel, Node.js, and a long list of other development environments from the Omarchy menu. Mise handles language versions, so each project can use what it needs.": "",
  "Set up your stack": "",
  "Four terminals, one choice": "",
  "Foot is the fast, lightweight default. Prefer Alacritty, Ghostty, or Kitty? All four are integrated, and switching your default keeps the same keyboard shortcuts working.": "",
  "Pick your terminal": "",
  "Developed by developers for developers": "",
  "The tools you know, set up to work together. Bring your projects, choose your favorites, and get straight to building.": "",
