  "Steam showing its game store on Omarchy": "",
  "Your PC gaming library, right at home on Linux. Steam and Proton bring a huge world of modern games to Omarchy.": "",
  "A classic arcade game running with RetroArch’s CRT shader": "",
  "Revisit the classics with a full set of emulator cores and the beautiful CRT Royale shader, already configured for that retro look.": "",
  "Minecraft running on Omarchy": "",
  "Build, explore, and make a world of your own. Install Minecraft straight from the Omarchy gaming menu and let your imagination run.": "",
  "Get your game on": "",
  "All work and all play is all good": "",
  "Omarchy comes ready for Steam, RetroArch, and a whole world of gaming. Graphics drivers and configuration, including NVIDIA on supported hardware, are sorted during installation.": "",
  "The latest laptops": "",
  "Ready for something new? Laptops like the latest Dell XPS make amazing Omarchy machines, with our core team helping the newest hardware work properly.": "",
  "Meet the team behind it": "",
  "Vintage Macs": "",
  "Give that old Intel Mac a second life. Omarchy brings a fresh desktop to the hardware you already love.": "",
  "Mac support": "",
  "Potato PCs": "",
  "Even a 2011 ThinkPad X220 with 2GB of RAM can run Omarchy, with room to spare. Your old PC might have plenty left to give.": "",
  "Watch the potato run": "",
  "It runs on almost anything": "",
  "You don't need a new machine to try Omarchy. But if you get one, today's laptops are amazing.": "",
