  "No invitation-only &ldquo;official Omarchy&rdquo; events. Capacity limits are obviously fine.": "",
  "Organizers speak for themselves, not for Omarchy or the Omacom Foundation. &ldquo;Omarchy Meetup&rdquo; means community event, not official endorsement.": "",
  "Free is preferred. Charging to cover venue, food, or actual event costs is fine; don&rsquo;t turn the Omarchy name into an events business.": "",
